# flowr

Workflow orchestrator written in Go. Runs a DAG of shell steps declared in a YAML file.

## Layout

- `cmd/flowr/` — CLI entry point (`main.go`).
- Build with `go build -o /usr/local/bin/flowr ./cmd/flowr`.
- Runtime artifacts live under `.flowr/runs/<run_id>/` inside the working directory from which `flowr run` is invoked.

This repository starts with module metadata and project documentation; source files are expected under `cmd/flowr/`.
